---
title: eCommerce Channel & Operations Manager
gender: m/w/d
employmentType: vollzeit
location: Eislingen oder München
applyUrl: >-
  https://schlafgut.factorialhr.de/job_posting/ecommerce-channel-operations-manager-m-w-d-293072
